msgctxt "DewfordTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_StoneCavern"
msgid ""
"There's a stone cavern at the edge\n"
"of town.\p"
"I've heard you can find rare stones\n"
"there.$"
msgstr ""
"在镇子的尽头有一个石洞。\p"
"听说在那里\n"
"能找到稀有的石头。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "DewfordTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FaintedMonCanUseHM"
msgid ""
"Even if a POKéMON faints and can't\n"
"battle, it can still use a move learned\l"
"from a HIDDEN MACHINE (HM).$"
msgstr ""
"即使宝可梦陷入濒死、无法对战，\n"
"也还是能使用通过秘传学习器\l"
"学会的招式。$"
